## Overview

NED-OS is a personal Linux customization and desktop productivity project focused on creating a personalized, efficient, and visually consistent Linux environment.

The project began with Linux Mint and later transitioned to Fedora. It includes desktop customization, terminal enhancements, shell scripts, system utilities, and a custom GNOME Control Center.

## Development History

